      {
        "text": "In a time path dream realm, Fang Yuan is brought to treat Meng Bi. A servant says his master bought a water text Gu from a merchant who claimed it would let him write beautiful words resembling flowing water. Meng Bi had been called brutish, with brawn but no literary flair, so he paid a high price, wanting to write a beautiful verse that night.",
