    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "At first the Gu worked. Meng Bi wrote fifty to sixty texts and was happy. By morning, before he ate, he had diarrhea more than twenty times, and even his tough body was left frail. Fang Yuan judges that water text Gu itself was not the problem: overusing it caused the diarrhea, a side effect nobody could deal with.",
